Package: librsvg-c2
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: librsvg2-2
Replaces: librsvg2-2
Provides: librsvg2-2 (= ${binary:Version})
Description: SVG rendering library (shared library)
 C library that renders SVG to Cairo (librsvg-2.0 API, SONAME
 librsvg-2.so.2). Replaces Debian/Devuan librsvg2-2 (GNOME/Rust).
 .
 CSS uses the in-tree css/ engine. libcroco is not built or packaged.

Package: librsvg-c-common
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libs
Depends: librsvg-c2 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: librsvg2-common
Replaces: librsvg2-common
Provides: librsvg2-common (= ${binary:Version})
Description: SVG rendering library (gdk-pixbuf loader)
 gdk-pixbuf SVG loader (libpixbufloader-svg.so) and thumbnailer.
 Replaces Debian/Devuan librsvg2-common.
 .
 Maintainer scripts refresh loaders.cache; they do not ship a
 system-wide cache file.

Package: librsvg-c-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libdevel
Depends: librsvg-c2 (= ${binary:Version}),
         libcairo2-dev,
         libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-dev,
         libglib2.0-dev,
         libpango1.0-dev,
         libxml2-dev,
         libgif-dev,
         libavif-dev,
         libpng-dev,
         libjpeg-dev,
         libwebp-dev,
         ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: librsvg2-dev
Replaces: librsvg2-dev
Provides: librsvg2-dev (= ${binary:Version})
Description: SVG rendering library (development files)
 Headers and pkg-config for librsvg-2.0. Replaces Debian/Devuan
 librsvg2-dev. Introspection (gir1.2-rsvg-2.0) is not shipped.

Package: librsvg-c-bin
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Section: graphics
Depends: librsvg-c2 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: librsvg2-bin
Replaces: librsvg2-bin
Provides: librsvg2-bin (= ${binary:Version})
Description: SVG rendering library (command-line tools)
 rsvg-convert, its man page, and bash Tab completion. Replaces
 Debian/Devuan librsvg2-bin. There is no --completion flag.
